\"text-xs text-emerald-950/80\">「5と0のつく日」クーポン＋直前限定クーポンで大幅割引。</p></div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-rose-950 text-sm\">④ 郊外・穴場温泉エリアを狙う</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-rose-950/80\">有名観光地から30分圏内の郊外温泉街には空室が残りやすい。</p></div>\n</div>\n<hr class=\"my-8 border-emerald-950/10\" />\n<h2 id=\"ranking\">🏨 2. 京都府のお盆直前おすすめ宿一覧</h2>\n<p>楽天トラベルの京都府エリア掲載宿から、高評価な施設を厳選掲載しています。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/10 via-orange-500/10 to-yellow-500/10 border border-amber-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900 bg-amber-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase\">✨ おすすめ 第1位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">京都府</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-800\">⭐ 4.2 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/32464/32464.jpg\" alt=\"貸切風呂旅館　こぶし（ＡＳＯＢＩＹＵＫＵ　京都るり渓温泉）\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-amber-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-amber-950\">貸切風呂旅館　こぶし（ＡＳＯＢＩＹＵＫＵ　京都るり渓温泉）</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-amber-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">京阪神から約1時間！標高550ｍの高原スパリゾートで天然温泉と本格会席料理。3世代で楽しめる！！</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F32464%2F32464.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-600 to-orange-600 hover: